# Experiment output -- produced by a run, never source.
#
#   TRACKED    experiments/exN/*        config.yaml, README.md, design notes -- the
#                                       files that DESCRIBE the experiment
#   IGNORED    experiments/exN/<any>/   results/, plots/, figures/, equivalence/ and
#                                       anything added later -- the files a RUN writes
#
# Without this, a Colab run and a laptop run fight over the same generated files, and
# every framework's CSVs and PNGs land in the diff of the next commit.
#
# The rule ignores the CONTENTS of each subfolder rather than the subfolder itself.
# git cannot re-include a file whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded, so `experiments/*/*/`
# would make the .gitkeep exception below impossible -- and then a fresh clone would not
# have the folders at all.
experiments/*/*/**
!experiments/*/*/.gitkeep
